  been kept simple but smart with good  workmanship and fine materials a handy  solution for drinks has been integrated  into the car rack center console studs  in the bottle holders allow occupants to  open and close bottles with only one  hand the optional digital instrument  cluster offers a choice of four  different display modes the 9.2 inch  infotainment system supports gesture  control car rock buyers can choose  between the six-speed manual and the  7-speed dual-clutch automatic  transmission all-wheel drive is  available as an option  [Music]  DeNooyer Amanda will notices the car  rack absorbs road bumps quite nicely as  an SUV it is set higher and the  suspensions a bit softer and with the  all-wheel-drive on this test car it can  go off-road with no problems in the fun  with 18 centimeters of clearance and a  ramp angle of nearly 20 degrees even  rough roads and big chuckles won't stop  it  [Music]  an electronically controlled multi-plate  clutch combines data from various  sources such as the RPMs steering angle  and longitudinal and lateral  acceleration for the optimal  distribution of torque  the man was decided that all in all the  car rock is a success it owes quite a  lot to its big brother the Kodiak  but it's far more compact and that makes  a difference that enhances dynamics  especially in curves and improves the  chances of finding a parking spot the  car rock starts at under twenty four  thousand three hundred euros in Germany  while a Kodiak will cost at least two  thousand more  [Music]  you
 

